# ---------- local verification artifacts ----------
# Screenshots and run notes from end-to-end checks. They render live sessions —
# real project names, real quota, real spend — so they stay on the machine that
# produced them. Anything meant for readers goes in docs/img/ instead.
/docs/e2e/
